<!--
  Merge these keys into ios/App/App/Info.plist after `npx cap add ios`.
  Only keys for capabilities the app actually uses are listed. Do not add
  NSUserTrackingUsageDescription: the app does not track and App Store Connect
  flags an empty tracking string.
-->
<key>NSFaceIDUsageDescription</key>
<string>Cuidala uses Face ID to lock your home’s chores and restock list so only you can open them.</string>
<key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
<string>Cuidala uses your location once during setup to pick weather-based and seasonal tasks. Only coordinates rounded to about one kilometre are kept.</string>
<key>ITSAppUsesNonExemptEncryption</key>
<false/>
<key>WKAppBoundDomains</key>
<array>
  <string>api.open-meteo.com</string>
  <string>api.zippopotam.us</string>
</array>
<key>NSAppTransportSecurity</key>
<dict>
  <key>NSAllowsArbitraryLoads</key>
  <false/>
</dict>
